---

This firmware is a fork of claude-desktop-buddy
(https://github.com/anthropics/claude-desktop-buddy), retargeted to speak
to subctl instead of Claude desktop. The wire protocol it implements is
documented in REFERENCE.md of the upstream project.

The ASCII species art in src/buddies/*.cpp is inherited from the upstream
project and remains under its MIT license. New subctl-themed species art
will replace these files over time; see docs/ROADMAP.md.
